<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bank sets warrants on COSCO.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank sets warrants on COSCO.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG London Branch said it has launched 554 million American-style call warrants on shares of COSCO Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$5.865     PREMIUM	 15.77 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.21235   GEARING	 3.25X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  20.MAR.98    PAYDATE	 TO BE ANNOUNCED</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$6.90</p>
<p> NOTE		  GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
